  "_comment": [
    "Placeholder melee weapons (owner request, 14 Nov 2026). Stand-ins for weapons the Armory does not",
    "have yet: each is a clone of a donor weapon with the SAME look and a cloned blade piece whose",
    "damage_factor is raised to the melee ladder target (tools/melee_ladders.json) for its tier and culture.",
    "Every generated id starts with the tag below, so a real weapon can replace a placeholder later:",
    "  git grep taom_ph_   lists every placeholder piece, item and troop that carries one.",
    "To replace one: give its troops the new Armory weapon, then delete its entry here and rerun",
    "tools/generate_placeholder_weapons.py --apply (it rewrites the generated files without it).",
    "",
    "Fields: id (item id, must start with the tag), donor (Armory CraftedItem to clone), tier (ladder tier",
    "the DPS target is taken from), tiers ([lo, hi] troop tiers that get it), cultures (troop culture ids),",
    "name (English display name; the {=id} key is added by the tool), blend (optional, default 1; 0.5 lands halfway between the donor and the ladder target, owner choice for Erebor 14 Nov 2026)."
  ],
